sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant WebApp
    participant AuthService
    participant UserDB

    User->>WebApp: submit current and new password
    WebApp->>AuthService: request password change
    AuthService->>UserDB: verify current password hash
    UserDB-->>AuthService: password hash valid
    AuthService->>UserDB: store new password hash
    AuthService-->>WebApp: password changed confirmation
    WebApp-->>User: display success message
